# KYAI Data License

The contents of this `data/` directory, and the public JSON feeds generated
from it (`/feed/signals.json`, `/feed/events.json`, `/feed/profiles.json`,
`/feed/toolkits.json`, `/feed/regions.json`), are licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0).

You are free to:

- Share — copy and redistribute the material in any medium or format
- Adapt — remix, transform, and build upon the material for any purpose,
  including commercially

Under the following terms:

- Attribution — You must give appropriate credit to KYAI, provide a link to
  this license, and indicate if changes were made.

Suggested attribution:

    Data from KYAI (https://kyai.com), licensed under CC BY 4.0.

Full license text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode
Human-readable summary: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

## Scope and limits

- This license covers KYAI's own compilation, structuring, and editorial
  annotation of the records in this directory.
- It does not and cannot license the underlying third-party sources that
  individual records link to. Headlines, article text, research papers, and
  institutional documents remain the property of their publishers. KYAI
  records store a title, a link, and KYAI's own summary — not the source work.
- Contributors who submit records to KYAI agree to publish their contribution
  under CC BY 4.0.
- The KYAI name, wordmark, and logo files in `assets/` are not covered by this
  license and remain the property of KYAI.

The software in this repository is licensed separately under the MIT License.
See the `LICENSE` file in the repository root.
